- `apps/mobile/` — Expo / React Native app (BP §18). **Expo modules/SDK only — never Expo cloud:** no EAS Build/Submit/Update, no expo-updates, no expo.dev deployment; release builds are local (`npx expo prebuild` then Xcode/fastlane, same ASC-key lane as the native apps) and updates ship through the App Store. pnpm's default isolated layout and Expo's automatic Metro monorepo config (SDK 54+): keep `metro.config.js` at the default, and fall back to `nodeLinker: hoisted` in `pnpm-workspace.yaml` only if a native dependency won't resolve. New Architecture only. Distinct identity from any sibling app: bundle id `{{BUNDLE_PREFIX}}.mobile`, URL scheme `{{CODENAME}}` — change id, scheme, OAuth redirect and deep-link prefixes TOGETHER. After dependency changes run `npx expo install --fix`. Pure `lib/` helpers (no runtime RN import; `import type` only) get Node-env vitest; UI flows get Maestro on a device, asserting by `testID`, including every Back/Close return path.
